{"id":"62983ac7606858a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Sharp For Real","display":"df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real — ZFC Inner3 Sharp For Real","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real — ZFC Inner3 Sharp For Real","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-sharp-for-real — ZFC Inner3 Sharp For Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7fffbf0fc82b6138\" href=\"?note=7fffbf0fc82b6138\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" href=\"?note=a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md\">../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\#\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(x^\\#\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 采用本书成员语言编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner=g(\\varphi)\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner=g(\\varphi)\\)</span>。原二元接口隐去的编码函数现在明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，不增加有效性或满射要求。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C,\\in\\rangle\">\\(\\langle C,\\in\\rangle\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indisc}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Indisc}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 中表示元语言类结构，不是含真类的集合有序对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^k\">\\(V^k\\)</span> 表示长 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的集合函数类；类量词只位于元语言。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(y,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(y,A)\\)</span> 由书内相对可构造层级定义。下式先把实数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 编成序数子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_x\">\\(A_x\\)</span>，再定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[x]\">\\(L[x]\\)</span>；此处保留原文存在递增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 序列及其完整理论的约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PairNat}\">\\(\\mathrm{PairNat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{PairNat}^{\\#}_{58}(m,n)\\coloneqq\\frac{(m+n)(m+n+1)}2+n\\qquad(m,n\\in\\omega),\\\\\nx\\in\\omega^\\omega\\to A_x\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{PairNat}^{\\#}_{58}(n,x(n)):n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nx\\in\\omega^\\omega\\to L[x]\\coloneqq\n\\{y\\in V:\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(y,A_x)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{PairNat}^{\\#}_{58}(m,n)\\coloneqq\\frac{(m+n)(m+n+1)}2+n\\qquad(m,n\\in\\omega),\\\\\nx\\in\\omega^\\omega\\to A_x\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{PairNat}^{\\#}_{58}(n,x(n)):n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nx\\in\\omega^\\omega\\to L[x]\\coloneqq\n\\{y\\in V:\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(y,A_x)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Indisc}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(I,\\langle C,\\in\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(I,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(I)\\subseteq C\\cap\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\land\\forall m&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\;I(m)\\in I(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(I)^k\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\;(a(i)\\in a(j)\\land b(i)\\in b(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(C,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;k\\})\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(C,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,b(i)\\rangle:i&lt;k\\})\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Indisc}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(I,\\langle C,\\in\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(I,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(I)\\subseteq C\\cap\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\land\\forall m&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\;I(m)\\in I(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(I)^k\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\;(a(i)\\in a(j)\\land b(i)\\in b(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(C,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;k\\})\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(C,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,b(i)\\rangle:i&lt;k\\})\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}for\\text{-}real}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}_S(x,x^\\#)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nx\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land x^\\#\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists I\\in V\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Indisc}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(I,\\langle L[x],\\in\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land x^\\#=\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L[x],\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,I(i)\\rangle:i&lt;k\\}))\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}for\\text{-}real}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3SharpForReal}_S(x,x^\\#)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nx\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land x^\\#\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists I\\in V\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Indisc}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(I,\\langle L[x],\\in\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land x^\\#=\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L[x],\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,I(i)\\rangle:i&lt;k\\}))\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原定义采用哪一套不可辨识序列理论的约定予以保留；不擅自加强为具有额外生成性条件的规范 sharp。补齐 L[x]、公式编码、序不可辨识性和类满意关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","he